<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE- Bank of Korea cuts '97 GDP growth forecast.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Bank of Korea cuts '97 GDP growth forecast.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central Bank of Korea (BOK) issued the following projections.</p>
<p>			GDP growth (yr/yr)   C/A    Inflation (yr/yr)</p>
<p>First half, 1997	 5.6		-11.2	  2.4</p>
<p>Second half, 1997	6.3		 -5.8	  1.9</p>
<p>Full year 1997	   6.0		-17.0	  4.3</p>
<p>First half, 1996	 7.3		 -9.82	 3.8</p>
<p>Second half, 1996	6.9		-13.9	  0.7</p>
<p>Full year 1996	   7.1		-23.72	 4.5</p>
<p>Note: C/A figures are in billions of US dollars</p>
</text>
